    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῠφοκόπος</span></b> , ὁ,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρτυγοκόπος</span>, player of the game
		described by <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i> s.h.v., <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Av.</u>
			1299
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυφοκόμπου</span> codd. and Sch.,
		but cf. <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			7.136
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			9.107
		</span></i>: Dionysius ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
		</span></i> read (or conjectured) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρτυγοκόμπου</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυφοκόμπος</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μάχιμος ἀλεκτρυών</span>
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
